Give extra point to the bum students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTake the assault and battery missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2872270/extras/ca43f7aa460e03c075736b8b4db27479.avif?t=1733596781\" width=650 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH YOUR CHOICES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tYour conversations with people will affect the rest of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tArrest anyone you don't trust or suspect! Or infiltrate the gang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
